message: "If you use this project, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "JPEG-inspired image compression with DCT and CSR sparse matrices"
abstract: >-
  Educational implementation of a JPEG-inspired lossy image compression:
  8x8 block DCT, quantization, high-frequency truncation and CSR sparse
  storage, available as a Python Streamlit app and as a C++20 command-line
  program.
